# AnyPS5 keyboard and mouse bindings. Rename this file to anyps5-input.ini (next to the game
# executable) to use it; see INPUT_MAPPING.md for every action and input source.
# Controllers (Xbox or PlayStation layout, through SDL) work without this file.
# The first line for an action replaces its built-in keys; later lines add alternatives.
#
# Built-in keys when this file is absent:
#   Cross = Enter / Space     Circle = C        Triangle = I        Square = left mouse
#   L1 = Q                    R1 = E / Alt      R2 = right mouse    L3 = Shift   R3 = Ctrl
#   Options = Esc             D-pad = arrow keys                    touchpad = Backspace / Tab
#   left stick = W A S D      right stick = T F G H                 mouse wheel = D-pad up / down
#   ToggleMouse = middle mouse                                      ToggleFullscreen = F11

# Example: a Souls-like layout (uncomment to use)
# Cross = KEY:Space
# Circle = KEY:Left Shift
# Triangle = KEY:Left Ctrl
# Square = KEY:R
# R1 = MOUSE:Left
# R2 = MOUSE:Right
# L1 = KEY:Q
# L2 = KEY:Z
# RightStickLeft = KEY:Left
# RightStickRight = KEY:Right
# RightStickUp = KEY:Up
# RightStickDown = KEY:Down
